    <briefdescription>
<para>Concurrent modification detected error. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classcslt_1_1ConcurrentModificationError" kindref="compound">ConcurrentModificationError</ref> represents an error when a container is modified during iteration (fail-fast behavior).</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Example Usage:</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">throw<sp/>ConcurrentModificationError();<sp/><sp/>//<sp/>&quot;Concurrent<sp/>modification<sp/>detected&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">throw<sp/>ConcurrentModificationError(&quot;Container<sp/>modified<sp/>during<sp/>iteration&quot;);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
